had been willing to do.<br/>\nIf only Edward hadn't wanted to sell the house and split the money. If only Robert hadn't wanted, equally as much, to keep it. Robert said that if their father had wanted the house to have been sold, he would have said so. Edward said that their father had known the house to have been outdated and ready to sell. Edward felt that if Robert's clan were prepared to have taken it on and buy the other one out, that would be a possibility.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le11ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "39000", "text": "If neither was willing to have compromised, then each was convinced to have had more right to the house than the other. The result was that the house on Cranberry Lane stood empty. Both families wished that the two brothers, who had been inseparable as children, would speak to each other.<br/>\nEdward was in his car when he heard the news. Robert saw it on television. A hurricane had struck the Florida Keys, very close to the town where they had grown up. It was the biggest and strongest hurricane to hit the coast in 200 years. Both wished they had known beforehand to close it up properly. If the reports were to have been believed, then the old place would have been in danger.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le11ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "75500", "text": "As soon as reports declared the storm was over, both brothers ran to their cars and headed for the airport. At virtually the same time, the two men boarded planes to Florida. Within minutes of each other, they reached the site of their childhood home.<br/>Edward looked up at Robert and slowly walked towards him. Robert imagined that they were children again, in their garden. Except that now their garden was a pool of mud, filled with the wreckage of the storm. What did material things mean when they could be destroyed within minutes? What meaning did a family house have without a family? Without speaking, the two men embraced.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le11ob06re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le11ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le11ob06re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}], "id": 0}]}